  "runtime_findings": [
    "Plain body text accepted crossed-out reference amounts in earlier benchmarks; v2 binds the visible current-price DOM node and exact card.",
    "The same room can have multiple refund/meal plans. Full cancelPolicy, importantInfo and price-panel regions are tied to the revalidated originating card.",
    "The web goal route omitted browser_stay_evidence entirely; exact tool search could not load it. Add the collector to TOOLS_WEB and retain schema deferral.",
    "New CSV rows were incorrectly routed to the existing-table aggregate verifier. Clarify the existing semantic classifier contract; no keyword intent matching and no aggregate gate bypass.",
    "A large artifact tool catalog hid the browser entry point. Keep browser_navigate initially callable while deferring large browser_batch; honor explicit browser requests in tool guidance."
  ],
